  "description": "Managed .NET library for high-fidelity DOCX-to-PDF conversion. Provides a thread-safe, async API with process isolation, automatic crash recovery, and font substitution diagnostics. Each conversion runs in a separate native worker process — a LibreOffice crash never affects your application. Supports file-path, byte-buffer, and stream-based conversion. Targets netstandard2.0 (.NET Framework 4.6.1+) and net8.0. Requires a platform-specific SlimLO.NativeAssets package (Linux, macOS, or Windows).",
